{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51760","headline":"敬礼瓦屋和尚塔偈（瓦屋和尚名能光，日本国人。） · 勾令玄","name":"敬礼瓦屋和尚塔偈（瓦屋和尚名能光，日本国人。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大空无尽劫成尘，玄步孤高物外人。\n日本国来寻彼岸，洞山林下过迷津。\n流流法乳谁无分，了了教知我最亲。\n一百六十三岁後，方於此塔葬全身。\n（同上）（〖1〗勾令玄，原作勾令元，爲清人讳改，从穴研斋影宋本《茅亭客话》改。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"勾令玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}